WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.900
World Masterpiece Theater

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
Homeless Child Remy

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
"About Love"

00:15.260 --> 00:23.200
I continue wishing to see you

00:23.690 --> 00:28.360
Today we'll go on a journey

00:28.450 --> 00:32.310
That's as endless as the blue sky

00:32.820 --> 00:40.990
With joy, sorrow and hope come setbacks

00:41.360 --> 00:46.040
They repeat, they repeat

00:46.280 --> 00:50.870
What should I believe?

00:51.510 --> 00:59.880
You know nothing about love, however

01:00.320 --> 01:08.900
Someday you will feel warmth inside

01:09.730 --> 01:19.860
I dream of the day when you'll speak of love

01:20.860 --> 01:28.660
Tomorrow, our journey will begin

01:29.510 --> 01:35.020
Presented by:
Takara Fansubs & Migoto

01:35.020 --> 01:39.380
Episode 14:
Beginning of a New Journey

01:54.190 --> 01:57.460
Please, open your eyes.
Please, look at me.

02:00.980 --> 02:02.440
Mr. Vitalis,

02:03.580 --> 02:07.330
we're going to Paris together.
We have to keep moving forward.

02:07.620 --> 02:11.080
You promised to go to Paris,

02:11.520 --> 02:17.840
and buy dogs and build a new troupe.
We'll all perform together

02:18.570 --> 02:20.220
again...

02:25.070 --> 02:29.020
Please don't leave me alone.

02:29.920 --> 02:32.850
Please don't die, don't die...

02:47.050 --> 02:48.570
Mr. Vitalis,

02:49.030 --> 02:51.320
I will go to Paris.

02:51.480 --> 02:54.370
Don't worry about me because Joli-Coeur and Capi will be with me.

02:55.710 --> 02:57.280
I won't cry anymore.

03:00.030 --> 03:02.350
Say goodbye to Mr. Vitalis.

03:24.830 --> 03:26.370
That's right, Capi.

03:27.720 --> 03:31.640
I'm sorry. I promised I wouldn't cry anymore.

03:34.110 --> 03:37.390
I will never forget you, Mr. Vitalis.

03:39.530 --> 03:43.390
Please watch over us forever.

03:52.450 --> 03:55.090
Good bye, Mr. Vitalis.

04:02.610 --> 04:05.870
Thanks for everything, Pastor.

04:06.460 --> 04:09.370
Are you going to Paris anyway?
- Yes.

04:10.010 --> 04:11.930
Paris is a big city.

04:12.240 --> 04:13.890
Will you be all right by yourself?

04:14.290 --> 04:16.910
I'm planning to visit someone called Gaspard.

04:17.070 --> 04:19.250
He's a friend of Mr. Vitalis.

04:19.250 --> 04:24.580
Hm... I see, you're going no matter what.

04:30.160 --> 04:33.580
May God protect you, Remy.

04:54.030 --> 04:55.860
Mr. Vitalis is no longer with us.

04:56.170 --> 04:57.930
He's gone somewhere far away.

05:01.280 --> 05:03.220
We can't stay here.

05:04.080 --> 05:05.930
We have to keep moving forward.

05:06.680 --> 05:10.720
Just like Mr. Vitalis always said: Keep moving forward.

05:20.110 --> 05:22.270
Look, that's Paris.

05:29.100 --> 05:32.560
Our new life will start over there.

05:57.620 --> 06:00.310
Where is Groussinou Avenue?

06:00.800 --> 06:03.790
Everything is so big so I'm totally lost.

06:06.040 --> 06:08.070
That's right. Let's ask somebody.

06:08.770 --> 06:11.970
Um, excuse me... Wait!

06:14.840 --> 06:17.390
Move! Move! Get out of the way!

06:49.110 --> 06:51.510
Joli-Coeur... You're cold, aren't you?

07:00.590 --> 07:02.730
Be patient, Joli-Coeur.

07:03.750 --> 07:05.290
So cold...

07:07.100 --> 07:11.040
Capi. Thank you, Capi.

07:12.450 --> 07:15.490
It'll be all right. We'll find Mr. Gaspard.

07:16.020 --> 07:18.430
Everything will be fine once we find Mr. Gaspard.

07:19.200 --> 07:21.840
He is Mr. Vitalis' friend after all.

07:45.630 --> 07:47.280
I'm sorry there isn't much.

07:47.760 --> 07:50.980
This is the last piece of bread that the pastor gave us.

07:53.380 --> 07:57.840
You ate it already?
You're hopeless, Joli-Coeur.

07:57.900 --> 07:59.860
This is your last piece, okay?

08:07.980 --> 08:09.140
Excuse me.

08:09.190 --> 08:10.000
Hm?

08:11.880 --> 08:15.980
I'm looking for Groussinou Avenue. Can you tell me how to get there?

08:16.220 --> 08:20.080
Groussinou Avenue!
You're going there by yourself?

08:20.080 --> 08:21.530
I have an acquaintance there.

08:22.370 --> 08:25.120
I see... Then that should be okay.

08:26.450 --> 08:29.030
You see that big street over there?

08:39.740 --> 08:42.380
Um... Where is Groussinou Avenue?

08:56.510 --> 08:58.780
It should be around here.

09:01.030 --> 09:04.010
Um... Where is Groussinou Avenue?

09:08.170 --> 09:09.520
Um...

09:09.630 --> 09:12.230
Make a turn at the corner over there.

09:14.360 --> 09:15.910
Thank you very much.

09:45.470 --> 09:48.070
I wonder where Mr. Gaspard's house is.

09:48.290 --> 09:53.330
You thief! Wait!
Give me back my money! Give it back!

09:53.400 --> 09:54.770
Shut up!

09:56.070 --> 09:57.130
Ahhhh!

09:57.630 --> 10:00.560
It was your fault that your money got stolen.

10:03.120 --> 10:06.250
Damn you! What are you looking at?

10:06.560 --> 10:12.200
Um... I'm looking for someone, a person called Gaspard.

10:12.950 --> 10:14.270
Don't know him.

10:23.600 --> 10:26.570
I'm all right, I'm all right.

10:26.880 --> 10:30.030
Now, let's find Mr. Gaspard's house.

10:34.160 --> 10:37.260
Um... Do you know someone named Gaspard?

10:42.090 --> 10:48.110
Gaspard... I think there was an old man who was called that.

10:48.260 --> 10:50.070
He was a street musician.

10:50.400 --> 10:53.990
I think he played the violin or the accordion.

10:54.810 --> 10:59.750
That's him. That's Gaspard. Where does he live?

11:02.350 --> 11:03.760
Thank you!

11:08.500 --> 11:10.330
Is this it? This is the place?

11:39.530 --> 11:42.570
Um, where is Gaspard's room?

11:45.040 --> 11:46.060
Thank you.

11:50.000 --> 11:50.660
Hmm.

12:00.910 --> 12:02.300
Is that room it?

12:05.250 --> 12:07.660
Ga-s-par-d...

12:08.340 --> 12:13.430
It says Gaspard. This is Mr. Gaspard's house. We've found it.

12:16.250 --> 12:19.430
Good evening. Is Mr. Gaspard here?

12:22.800 --> 12:25.750
Good evening. Is anyone here?

12:41.200 --> 12:43.650
Wow... So warm.

12:45.520 --> 12:49.670
Who's there? Who are you?

12:51.960 --> 12:54.560
If you're trying to steal the soup, you can't.

12:55.690 --> 12:56.540
Me?

12:57.140 --> 12:58.220
Errr...

12:59.450 --> 13:01.350
Why would I do that?

13:02.230 --> 13:04.410
I came here to see Mr. Gaspard.

13:04.410 --> 13:06.510
My boss?
- Right.

13:06.900 --> 13:08.800
Is he here?
- No.

13:08.870 --> 13:11.750
I see. Will he be coming back shortly?

13:11.890 --> 13:15.480
Probably in a while. He's a really moody person.

13:15.740 --> 13:16.820
I see.

13:16.960 --> 13:18.760
Why don't you wait here?

13:19.640 --> 13:20.480
Okay.

13:33.000 --> 13:34.020
I'm home.

13:34.130 --> 13:36.040
Welcome back, big brother Ricardo.

13:38.120 --> 13:43.120
Huh?  Are you a newbie?

13:43.490 --> 13:45.900
No... I'm Remy.

13:45.980 --> 13:48.850
A visitor... I was told she came to see our boss.

13:49.290 --> 13:52.990
Ah...

13:54.030 --> 13:55.820
Lise, I found something good.

13:55.950 --> 13:57.450
What is it?
- Here you go.

13:57.600 --> 13:59.540
Wow... An apple.

13:59.800 --> 14:03.270
Looks delicious, huh? I snatched it from the market.

14:03.330 --> 14:05.010
Keep it a secret from everyone.

14:05.010 --> 14:08.360
Your snatching skills are unbelieveable, big brother Ricardo.

14:11.130 --> 14:14.730
Wow... That's a monkey, isn't it? Come here.

14:15.260 --> 14:17.110
I told you to come here.

14:19.050 --> 14:21.340
You cheeky!
- Stop!

14:24.800 --> 14:26.060
Stop!

14:30.330 --> 14:33.070
Joli-Coeur, come here. Come back!

14:33.070 --> 14:35.490
All right...
- I said stop.

14:37.870 --> 14:40.410
Move.
- No.

14:43.430 --> 14:46.690
I understand. I'll stop. I'll stop it right now.

14:47.920 --> 14:49.660
It's too noisy.

14:50.940 --> 14:52.990
I can't sleep.

15:01.870 --> 15:04.940
Mattia... Why are you here?

15:05.070 --> 15:06.790
Did you skip out on work?

15:06.990 --> 15:12.920
No. I earned my money for today so I came back. It's pointless to work extra.

15:12.980 --> 15:14.660
Don't scare me like that.

15:17.920 --> 15:21.360
Ah... Joli-Coeur. Come here.

15:21.760 --> 15:22.590
Ah!

15:25.990 --> 15:27.350
What are you doing?

15:27.380 --> 15:29.510
Huh! You stole it anyway, didn't you?

15:30.090 --> 15:31.760
Hey, give it back.

15:34.800 --> 15:35.880
Idiot!

15:36.280 --> 15:37.980
What did you say!?

15:38.600 --> 15:40.010
Are you ready?

15:40.070 --> 15:43.180
Yes, today I'll finally be able to beat you up.

15:46.220 --> 15:47.280
I'm ready.

15:47.280 --> 15:48.580
Yeah.

15:53.280 --> 15:55.020
Stop, you guys.

15:55.260 --> 15:59.270
Stay back, stranger. You'll get hurt.

15:59.490 --> 16:00.570
No way.

16:01.250 --> 16:02.070
Oh...

16:04.050 --> 16:05.930
Stop behaving like an idiot.

16:08.900 --> 16:10.000
You too.

16:14.500 --> 16:16.110
Capi also says stop.

16:17.480 --> 16:19.530
Look, a smart dog.

16:19.810 --> 16:21.930
Smarter than you at least.

16:22.190 --> 16:24.160
Capi doesn't have to fight.

16:25.280 --> 16:30.190
Hahahaha. You're right.
He is smarter than Mattia.

16:32.330 --> 16:33.410
We're home.

16:33.810 --> 16:36.480
Wow... so cold, so cold. It started snowing again.

16:36.480 --> 16:38.640
Welcome back.

16:39.250 --> 16:41.630
You guys are all living here?

16:41.720 --> 16:43.000
That's right.

16:43.490 --> 16:46.370
Wow, monkey.
- Where did he come from?

16:46.860 --> 16:49.990
Old uncle Gaspard has a lot of children, doesn't he?

16:50.610 --> 16:52.880
Old uncle Gaspard?

16:57.550 --> 17:01.230
Old uncle Gaspard... That's great.

17:01.380 --> 17:03.850
Huh... Did I say something funny?

17:11.280 --> 17:15.230
What's going on here?
You look like you're having fun.

17:24.460 --> 17:26.470
Who are you?

17:26.780 --> 17:28.580
I'm Remy.
- Remy?

17:28.580 --> 17:33.410
A visitor. She said she came here to see you, boss.

17:33.410 --> 17:34.450
Me?

17:35.550 --> 17:37.770
Are you Mr. Gaspard?

17:38.520 --> 17:40.680
How can I help you?

17:40.970 --> 17:44.320
I was told by Mr. Vitalis... Well...

17:44.500 --> 17:47.050
You know Mr. Vitalis, right?

17:47.470 --> 17:49.300
I don't know him.

17:53.670 --> 17:58.870
Mr. Vitalis told me to see Mr. Gaspard who lives on Groussinou Avenue.

17:58.900 --> 18:03.030
He's an old but nice man.

18:03.230 --> 18:04.670
Old man?

18:05.000 --> 18:07.710
Ah! Now I understand who you're talking about.

18:07.710 --> 18:10.400
He's talking about old man Gaspard, he was my uncle.

18:10.660 --> 18:14.210
He died from the flu last year.

18:14.210 --> 18:14.910
What?

18:15.180 --> 18:17.190
He was a weird and stubborn old man.

18:17.430 --> 18:21.220
I took over this place after him.

18:26.770 --> 18:29.570
What is Vitalis doing?

18:31.950 --> 18:36.710
Mr. Vitalis passed away and he was worried about me so...

18:36.980 --> 18:40.920
Ah... He wanted the old man to look after you.

18:41.650 --> 18:43.790
Can you do any entertaining?

18:43.860 --> 18:44.490
Yes.

18:44.890 --> 18:47.620
Can you use that dog and monkey?

18:48.110 --> 18:52.100
We used to play in a show together as the Vitalis Troupe.

18:52.250 --> 18:54.700
Hm... I see.

18:59.060 --> 19:03.490
All right, I will let you live here.

19:04.090 --> 19:05.990
You don't have any relatives in Paris, right?

19:06.380 --> 19:07.200
Right...

19:07.950 --> 19:13.880
All the kids here either don't have relatives or were sent here as security for a loan.

19:14.160 --> 19:18.310
I give these kids a job and a place to work.

19:18.680 --> 19:24.430
She's useless. She can't do the work. She'll just be a burden to us.

19:25.980 --> 19:27.740
Shut up, Mattia.

19:27.850 --> 19:29.860
I don't need your opinion.

19:30.390 --> 19:31.200
Huh...

19:32.680 --> 19:34.680
You're late!

19:36.620 --> 19:41.250
Now, show me what you earned today.

19:44.930 --> 19:46.630
What did you say?!

19:47.970 --> 19:52.690
We're sorry, boss. I'm 4 sous short than the amount we were told.

19:52.820 --> 19:54.100
Me too by 2 sous.

19:54.760 --> 19:56.730
You guys start eating.

19:57.500 --> 20:01.130
You guys who didn't earn enough... Get over there!

20:12.770 --> 20:14.200
What are you going to do?
- Remy.

20:14.620 --> 20:18.680
Watch carefully. Someone who doesn't work doesn't get to eat.

20:18.680 --> 20:20.530
That is our rule here.

20:23.040 --> 20:23.730
Remy...

20:24.210 --> 20:25.450
Ricardo.

21:00.210 --> 21:02.390
Mattia... How are those kids?

21:02.720 --> 21:05.030
Stop whimpering like that.

21:05.210 --> 21:06.470
We have to get up early tomorrow.

21:06.640 --> 21:08.210
I'm not whimpering.

21:14.090 --> 21:15.220
Joli-Coeur.

21:20.700 --> 21:21.430
Remy.

21:22.820 --> 21:24.940
Don't worry about Mattia.

21:25.880 --> 21:28.310
I'll make a bed for you tomorrow, Remy.

21:28.400 --> 21:30.120
Please use this one for tonight.

21:32.030 --> 21:33.070
Thank you.

21:33.420 --> 21:36.970
Good night, Remy.
- Good night, Lise, Ricardo.

21:36.970 --> 21:37.960
Good night.

21:39.330 --> 21:41.950
<i>It's insane to stay here voluntarily.</i>

21:46.030 --> 21:52.640
<i>Mr. Vitalis, should I stay here? Please tell me what to do.</i>

21:55.710 --> 22:04.300
Surely, not everyone can be so strong

22:05.410 --> 22:15.650
The blue sky lifts all of the world's tears...

22:17.000 --> 22:26.390
Tomorrow's courage comes

22:26.610 --> 22:36.150
From the future that gives us our fate

22:36.550 --> 22:45.010
Try to seek for them more

22:46.160 --> 22:49.820
Give your heart to

22:49.880 --> 23:05.010
That person who is also seeking you

23:18.410 --> 23:21.030
Lise, make sure no one's coming.

23:21.210 --> 23:23.450
Mattia, you're not going to do something wrong, are you?

23:23.540 --> 23:26.800
Why does it matter!? If I don't bring enough money in, I'll be beaten!

23:27.590 --> 23:32.800
Stop kidding around. You know what will happen if you don't make enough money.

23:32.820 --> 23:35.900
<i>New Friends</i>

23:32.820 --> 23:35.900
Next time:
